<p>Hello <%= @resource.name %>,</p>

<p>Someone asked to reset the password for the <%= app_name %> account <strong><%= @resource.username %></strong>.</p>

<p><%= link_to "Choose a new password", edit_family_password_url(reset_password_token: @token) %></p>

<p>The link works for <%= distance_of_time_in_words(Devise.reset_password_within) %>. If you didn't ask for this, you can ignore this email: your password won't change.</p>
